flowchart LR
    C[RESP2 client] <--> L[TCP listener]
    L --> H[Per-client handler]
    H --> D[RESP2 decoder]
    D --> X[Command dispatcher]
    X -->|Stateful commands| S[(Shared in-memory store)]
    S --> X
    X --> E[RESP2 response writer]
    E --> H
    H --> C
    X -.->|PING and ECHO reply directly| E
